rent ideals, beliefs, and morals. Join them, betray them, or destroy them. It's all up to you.<br><br>    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>EXPLORATION:</strong> Explore hand-crafted celestial bodies in the Adallio star system. As you try to unwrap the mystery that has befallen you, you will make choices which will affect the way the story develops; along with how others perceive you, and end game scenarios.<br><br>    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CHOICES:</strong> There are always multiple ways to complete objectives. You can engage NPCs in dialogue to gather information, take the stealth approach to sneak past  them, or use combat and fight your way through enemies with a wide variety of weapons.<br><br>    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WEAPON CUSTOMISATION:</strong> Weapons can be  customised to your liking. There are various attachments which you can use to easily customise the weapons to suit your play style. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618330/extras/4ac52ff1f9f707e8eaa75d6b247103e6.poster.avif?t=1754242049\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618330/extras/4ac52ff1f9f707e8eaa75d6b247103e6.webm?t=1754242049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618330/extras/4ac52ff1f9f707e8eaa75d6b247103e6.mp4?t=1754242049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618330/extras/0d9a5e5266aefec08d7e5263ab097a48.poster.avif?t=1754242049\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/618330/extras/0d9a5e5266aefec08d7e5263ab097a48.